[{"client_msg_id":"5f77e513-669d-476a-9896-54f526d12903","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"参考になるところあんまりないとは思いますが、自分の設定こんな感じです\nsetoptやautoloadについて抜き出すとか部分的に役に立つかも\n\u003chttps://github.com/yukiycino-dotfiles/dotfiles/blob/master/.zshrc\u003e","ts":"1631074386.080000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pwI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"569b750b-aa1a-4b77-8dc4-8249af257e6a","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"実際調べようとしてもとてもだるいので","ts":"1631074208.078900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kQPi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0dac52ff-b641-43ca-99cc-6a9f02d5c909","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"これに関しては自分の問題ですが、まったく zsh について調べてなかったです。。。","ts":"1631074184.078600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=x3jn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4bccc049-9f2e-4206-b891-3205e29290f5","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"zsh、この辺の情報が調べにくくて辛いですよね","ts":"1631073805.078200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sdA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a882486a-1a14-4f25-b813-88ca3bedf06e","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"何回 npm run build 出るねん。って思っていましたｗ","ts":"1631073672.077700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aNP+J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"220ea25c-a5a2-4c3c-b756-9005e6464983","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"ignore_all_dups 入れよう。これもうるさいと思っていたのでｗ","ts":"1631073657.077300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eYrG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4cb795a0-dac7-489b-9573-97701dbea64d","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"それぞれ細かい挙動覚えてないんですがhistory系だとこういうの入れてそう\n```setopt hist_ignore_all_dups\nsetopt hist_ignore_dups\nsetopt hist_ignore_space\nsetopt hist_no_store\nsetopt hist_reduce_blanks\nsetopt hist_save_no_dups\nsetopt hist_verify```","ts":"1631073640.077000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s/6u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c20b6e9-6447-45ee-a421-c0aa090ad047","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"ありがとうございます！","ts":"1631073579.076500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zmB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6e2a7a62-6294-4d6f-9565-16d750c13173","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"zshrcにこれ書いてしばらく見てみるといいかも","ts":"1631073542.076300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"onTeD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"df0d3adb-c98e-4004-bfd1-0dfcf9f9f708","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"やってみます。","ts":"1631073539.076200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H6Q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7a6336e6-e0ba-4956-8761-43f8f3f1eff9","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"```setopt append_history\nsetopt share_history```","ts":"1631073533.075800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oEEg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5669e2bf-3681-431c-a2b4-2358bb2137c6","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"iTerm2(zsh) -\u0026gt; nvim -\u0026gt; terminal buffer(zsh)\nこういう状況。","ts":"1631073528.075600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5ROlt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0784ee8a-d618-4bf3-8a2c-8bca15c54ecc","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"append_historyがzsh_historyを作成ではなく追記するようにする設定\nshare_historyが別のzshでもhistoryを共有する設定です","ts":"1631073515.075000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"92aJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f324c66-e74c-4142-a99a-d3376ea51b5f","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"share_history 初耳です。（この辺まったくいじってないですｗ","ts":"1631073467.073900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vV3GP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d134347a-0a7e-4b1b-acea-fbb93c725c9c","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"あとappend_history","ts":"1631073465.073800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BA8eL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ea0845f1-8978-4801-bafe-516c641ba257","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"share_historyってどうしてます？","ts":"1631073456.073300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cx2JA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"034ae401-823e-43db-9ea8-f7e996c9f910","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"neovim は iTerm2 上で動いている zsh から立ち上げてます。","ts":"1631073439.073000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VCaw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"11d2cab6-3fad-4ae6-92b8-2e3a4b712c2c","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"nvim の terminal のヒストリが書かれた後に、iTerm2 を落とした時にもう一度ヒストリを書き込もうとする。\nその時、nvim の中で打ったコマンドがなかったことにされてるんじゃないかなあと。。。","ts":"1631073425.072400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qsjWF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81af4e13-4b86-420e-897c-29be3874b889","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"neovim って、shell から立ち上げてます？","ts":"1631073415.072100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IdC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"400cea6b-d7c1-4980-a204-f59a603b456c","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"これは予想なんですが","ts":"1631073356.070600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ork="}]},{"client_msg_id":"28d29230-9147-449a-aefc-9bf483649a70","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"zsh ですねー。","ts":"1631073349.070300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"npUdc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d5bf0531-1bdc-424f-b5d6-eb7028f9c92d","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"そんなことあるんだ・・・\nshellって何使ってます？","ts":"1631073343.070100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ShfxL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cf6a430d-b9e2-4ec5-afd9-e16f9a4023b9","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"正確には、入ったあと、別の内容で上書きされているような感じがします。。。","ts":"1631073340.070000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Smk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"928f9f0c-53f2-44c9-97a3-024b4166bff3","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"そうです。","ts":"1631073317.069400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ljc6w"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c088d7ce-eb76-423a-9d91-8e74f6a16f91","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"historyに入らないってことです？","ts":"1631073097.068800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ty0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b96a9b5b-d051-4cd0-a669-9b1d81c803e8","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"これ、なんらか設定を変更しないとだめだったりするのでしょうか？（この辺の設定全くいじってないのでおかしいのかもしれない）","ts":"1631073075.068500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EZ32"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ca01287-2ec2-4542-a3a1-a535691325f4","type":"message","user":"U8R597E9H","text":"neovim の terminal のヒストリがちょいちょいちゃんと保存されないっていうの、今までずっと目をつむってきたのですが","ts":"1631073047.067900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rqd8"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U02DSF5LU84","text":"\u003c@U02DSF5LU84\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1631061195.067